Here's a PHP program that can flatten a multi-dimensional array without using any built-in functions or methods:

```php
<?php

function flattenArray($array) {
    $result = [];

    foreach ($array as $value) {
        if (is_array($value)) {
            $nestedArray = flattenArray($value);
            foreach ($nestedArray as $nestedValue) {
                $result[] = $nestedValue;
            }
        } else {
            $result[] = $value;
        }
    }

    return $result;
}

